step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test best_single ETS to see if a single strong model can beat the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the most stable pool1 models to see if median beats mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a strong single model that performed best in window 1 – THETA – to see if a single best model can beat the mean baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the moderately stable pool2 to see if it improves over the baseline mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the full pool to see if removing outliers improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter on pool1 to see if a different aggregation improves over mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median over the moderately stable pool3 to see if it outperforms current best trimmed_mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over the more stable pool2 to see if it beats the trimmed mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test the best_single strategy with the strong only‑FT‑rf model to see if a single top performer beats the ensemble mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a single strong model (ETS) to see if it beats the ensemble mean on this series.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over the moderately stable pool3 to see if it beats current best trimmed_mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Try a weighted combination on the stable pool3 using inverse error weighting to see if that beats the trimmed mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["THETA","catboost","DWT_rf","FT_rf","CWT_catboost","FT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the stable pool4 to see if fewer models reduce noise.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

